{"steam_appid":1083070,"steam_name":"Sapper - Defuse The Bomb Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1083070/348147/b5ce5789493451914d6ef23c7d7bbcff6f40082e/1751186072/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1613464210","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256822593/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1613464210","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/ss_5378c0f67ab2e4190582c4b495f27aa5b324f3f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728898792","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/ss_0ed082a0c9b5cdb7335f9255487e6b0a9d16640d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728898792","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/ss_385031e3eda204a856be74bc13f73930ba5a005e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728898792","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/ss_4299aef178d7549375dd4eb75f20ebcf79e9eada.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728898792","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/ss_02ed5470c1a00040cb35dd794adfad2129550d4c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728898792"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/adc2ba30454b14df1732ea5197862f08.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/adc2ba30454b14df1732ea5197862f08.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/adc2ba30454b14df1732ea5197862f08.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to a simulator where one decision can be the last and the line between life &amp; death is thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A brief description of the profession of Sapper: unforgiving, underpaid, working under constant stress and in difficult conditions.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/c61d5af68e110bc3fd696525f626ac67.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/c61d5af68e110bc3fd696525f626ac67.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/c61d5af68e110bc3fd696525f626ac67.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Remember you don't do this job for fame, relaxation, or money. You are here to save lives. Show you have the guts and enlist now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/29c09c9b8c79ec7e3cd6b0e0b94a691f.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=591 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/29c09c9b8c79ec7e3cd6b0e0b94a691f.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HERE ARE THE THING YOU WILL DO AS A SAPPER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WORKING IN DIFFERENT LOCATIONS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0a3f2d1787174bf61f9d1d307f175630.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0a3f2d1787174bf61f9d1d307f175630.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0a3f2d1787174bf61f9d1d307f175630.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You shouldn't get bored here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SEARCHING</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/ad09b76b6fbbbf324e847932f015d9db.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/ad09b76b6fbbbf324e847932f015d9db.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/ad09b76b6fbbbf324e847932f015d9db.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are tons of places to search for the bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>LOCKPICKING</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/290055409ea718ae9a242383d3200d95.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/290055409ea718ae9a242383d3200d95.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/290055409ea718ae9a242383d3200d95.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are many locked doors, but that can't stop you from saving lives, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>HACKING</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/92630f2f792f7ca83e59b4258bb3abd3.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/92630f2f792f7ca83e59b4258bb3abd3.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/92630f2f792f7ca83e59b4258bb3abd3.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>It's good that you haven't spent all your time on games using your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>TRAINING</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/5a5484385568452e7fb8a05dad190c53.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/5a5484385568452e7fb8a05dad190c53.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/5a5484385568452e7fb8a05dad190c53.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A rookie without training is a dead rookie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WORKING UNDER PRESSURE OF TIME</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0163a772bcd7b550e9386c6e0cceecef.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0163a772bcd7b550e9386c6e0cceecef.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0163a772bcd7b550e9386c6e0cceecef.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Nerves of steel are a must in this job. No shaky hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FINDING THE BOMBS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/6b37375e5850d6495ca72b0abadb989f.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/6b37375e5850d6495ca72b0abadb989f.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/6b37375e5850d6495ca72b0abadb989f.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>If you want to defuse the bomb, first you need to find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong> DEFUSING THE BOMBS AND MINES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/75e657f7ea9ad47640c0d8f2d96101a0.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/75e657f7ea9ad47640c0d8f2d96101a0.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/75e657f7ea9ad47640c0d8f2d96101a0.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Now here is where the real &quot;fun&quot; starts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you willing to take on one of the most dangerous jobs in human history! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check what kind of bombs you will need to defuse first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/f0964b375b95787497678fcc5699fd58.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay safe, and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/32ac5e11c7579b855e71cc65ea0555c6.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/32ac5e11c7579b855e71cc65ea0555c6.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/32ac5e11c7579b855e71cc65ea0555c6.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share your opinion with us on the special discord channel.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Windows Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX970</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Simulation"],"developers":["Live Motion Games"],"publishers":["WIG Publishing"],"release_date":"23 Jan, 2023"}